  (text "National 27C010/020/040/080 package comparison is the source for these pin roles.\nUse a device-specific adapter; role changes require keyed selection or HV-rated switching.\nPin1 must never receive VPP when it is A19. Pin24 changes from OE to OE/VPP on 080.\n27C080 cannot use a generic 32-pin VPP-pin1 adapter. Program profiles remain disabled.\nRead VPP pins require +5V, not an unpowered VPP_SW. See device_profiles.json for verified status." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 173 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "8eb63a6e-12d4-560b-b787-32791a8a9977"))
